cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use parallax-notan in research, please cite it as below."
title: "parallax-notan: texture-robust Notan mass and a tonal-versus-chromatic construction signature"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Parrish
    given-names: Russell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9781-7995
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
url: https://www.parallaxmetrology.com
repository-code: https://github.com/parallaxmetrology/notan
keywords: [notan, composition, painting, value structure, colour, deterministic, image analysis]
abstract: >
  A deterministic reading of an image's large light and dark masses, robust to texture,
  with a construction signature that measures how much of the mass survives greyscale,
  tone-curve and contrast changes, and a per-pixel map of where structure depends on colour.
  Ships nine synthetic images with known answers for testing mass and composition measures.
